INTRODUCTION:

	FlamboPage iz a CNet/3 pager replacement that iz meant to give a
sysop a bit more configurability and style to existing cnet/3 pager.  I
found that the pager as iz, was a little bit boring.

	Thus, being totally bored, i decided to write a small util that
would end the cnet/3 pager nightmares i used to have while lying in bed
late in the dreary mid-summer nights we have here up in canada.

	It's a SIMPLE util that really doesn't need much explaining, which
is good, because i'm not know for my amazing documentation skills anyway.  
Moving right along here... FlamboPage's gui was written using GUITools
v38.1, © Carsten Ziegeler, (thanx!).

E-Z INSTALLATION:
	
1>	Copy the GUITools.library that's included with this archive into yer
	LIBS: dir... (FLaMBoPage/libs/)

2>	Copy the FLaMBoPaGe program into any desired directory...
	(I use Pfiles:Utilz/)

3>	Make a modification to yer CNet:bbsmenu file az such:
	
	**BEFORE**
	
	2; Available everywhere
		Help
		Chat <- Change this to sumthing, anything.
		Time

	**AFTER**

	2; Available everywhere
		Help
		BLAH <- This iz what i've changed my copy to.
		Time

	After you've made that change, then move to this section of BBSTEXT:
	
	2; Available everywhere
		...
		NSal
		FReq
		QWK
		
	And add...

		Chat |^Q#2 {Path}/FLaMBoPaGe}

	There!  Now, reload yer BBSTEXT with the Reload BBSTEXT/BBSMENU
	option from the Control Panel's menu set.

3>	Run FLaMBoPaGe either from Shell or WorkBench... 
	This will bring up the Pager Window with only the Config Button 
	un-ghosted.

	CLICK on Config.

	Here you are presented with the Config GUI...  It's REALLY
	self-explanatory.  The ListView holds 10 comments of three
	subjects; Chat, Gone, and Dump.  As you can see by clicking on each
	button to the right of the ListView thing-a-ma-bob, all the entries
	are filled with Chat:Gone:Dump#x...

	ALL 30 Messages should be changed to your own right away... take
	your time, i know there iz a lot of 'em... but that gives the whole
	thing sum character!

	Next are a few gadgets at the bottom of the window... 

	Attempts:
	This iz a slider that moves from 0 to 9... This iz how many times the
	page sound will be played.  Find a suitable duration for you.
	(I have mine cranked out to 10 attempts... I need the extra time to
	 roll outta bed.)

	Player:
	CLICK on the '?' button to open a FileRequester, or just type into
	the STRING gadget the path and filename of the sound player CNet/3
	iz currently uzing...

	Sound:
	Guess...

4>	CLICK on Save... or if ewe decide against it, Quit...  The
	FLaMBoPaGe.DAT file will be stored in you S: directory.

5>	Pat yerself on the back... you have just made it through what iz known
	to man-kind az THE most HORRIBLE dox that ever wuz/will b.


